# An Obvious Lie (Q032): a level 45 character accepts at Maximilian; Gentler gives a map, which
# Miki the Cat takes; twenty alligators each drop a medicinal herb (the twentieth moves the quest
# on); Gentler takes the herbs, then five hundred spirit ores; Miki agrees to the lie; Gentler
# offers the ears and sews cat ears from five hundred suede and a thousand threads, and the quest
# completes; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
